                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-08e359a4-a870-4e1e-a4fa-5b74a032872d" type="punctum" xml:id="m-f18fc85d-51f3-45db-9b6e-c974478bab5d">
                    <nc xml:id="m-0cb7c7aa-55b8-4ba3-aa2a-ff35fa49fd47" pname="g" oct="3">
                      <signifLet xml:id="m-c85ea3d8-8af8-46a9-b3e2-13be38ac8dc4" />
                    </nc>
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <divLine xml:id="m-dc8825f3-21f6-44f5-b1e8-a6481b102aa8" facs="#m-ee8cebb6-fc7c-440e-b3db-61f13b0969f2" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-3ccd454d-e7db-4031-9646-527f466c5066">
              <lg xml:id="m-b86ba465-d678-469f-98c2-376cc305230e">
                <l xml:id="m-0281ff58-b371-4285-be9c-5fb94fa8118a" facs="#m-710cd4ec-3edb-442f-8c70-69ca14405cc6" label="ambiguous">228</l><l xml:id="m-832848c8-08b9-443a-83ef-b4ef9df0223c" facs="#m-606043ae-163d-4308-8869-c8740a33da9d" label="text-like">Sunday at Prime.</l><l xml:id="m-b7c462b1-1a20-4f29-86ed-3b5c86689ded" facs="#m-820acb64-1333-4e3e-80d7-57879385b22d" label="lyrics-like">Ita Dóminus Páter, Dóminus Fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-304665cc-bdcf-4832-8cd2-e83383557a98" facs="#m-515cb1a6-4f8e-4398-9e97-cbf41bfba48f" label="lyrics-like">Déus est ex substántia Pátris ante</l><l xml:id="m-38c15a2d-1fe3-4958-a5d6-4c615a17de93" facs="#m-ed260250-00dc-4091-89b6-987420053ec9" label="lyrics-like">lius, * Dóminus Spiritus Sánctus.</l><l xml:id="m-26ecac85-4ae0-4236-9bf3-2ec3f4c66f36" facs="#m-5560ce4d-5611-450e-9d40-ca3f4962e4d4" label="lyrics-like">saécula génitus: “ et hómo est ex</l><l xml:id="m-5b5af5f7-bcf5-48ca-b043-64e6e8269835" facs="#m-c72b5fea-669a-4782-91a0-0e1b50703812" label="lyrics-like">Et tamen non tres Dómini, * sed</l><l xml:id="m-36f67e22-52de-496e-98a4-d9b6409dcd3d" facs="#m-6eb4194a-da3a-496a-a4e0-c7ca08e12c85" label="lyrics-like">substántia mátris in saéculo ná¬</l><l xml:id="m-682fc4c8-f907-47c8-a6ab-ee7adf78192f" facs="#m-5e1d72cc-db7e-4ab3-b25c-e7e48b15503c" label="lyrics-like">únus est Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-774b9e70-c519-49af-b27b-e49b38749078" facs="#m-fb9024f3-4047-4136-8299-9a425379e9e2" label="ambiguous">tus.</l><l xml:id="m-729aa27e-d1e7-4e79-939b-054dd5831294" facs="#m-8b2ef7ea-f7be-4e7c-aed9-35222e1aab93" label="lyrics-like">Perféctus Déus, perféctus hómo:*</l><l xml:id="m-6237cd45-dfec-4f3c-b76b-f53ce4b54198" facs="#m-80a7d87d-b94a-4254-8608-a67b16c23d03" label="lyrics-like">Quia sicut singillátimunamquám¬</l><l xml:id="m-17add2c8-fb21-4578-b092-8ec95c9cb1f7" facs="#m-d01ed7a4-c90f-4e00-8e17-1286f4f9d4f5" label="lyrics-like">ex ánima rationáli et humána earne</l><l xml:id="m-5732a840-042e-41be-aaa6-7eef5ffc2f97" facs="#m-2015816e-d64d-4491-a41e-fb17808c747d" label="lyrics-like">que persónam Déum ac Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-fc021e06-43ab-474a-9b6d-0e1e1d4f2816" facs="#m-c0651289-c5e8-4345-a86e-88355e455105" label="lyrics-like">confitéri christiána veritâte com¬</l><l xml:id="m-968198c4-7caf-4dc5-9a34-ee5f72d6b13f" facs="#m-17ce168a-0727-40cb-88fb-970255d3137c" label="ambiguous">subsistens.</l><l xml:id="m-858674bc-d51f-4f7d-8c85-40c6a7f3ec9f" facs="#m-da2c6335-467b-4d50-a33e-416091454395" label="lyrics-like">péllimur :“ ita tres Déos aut Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-30c0b1ab-95fa-41aa-98f1-010a0dd984a4" facs="#m-3412d11f-dd69-45ef-b505-5c3a59d2c30f" label="lyrics-like">Aequális Pátri secúndum divini¬</l><l xml:id="m-65e72bfa-eba7-4c5d-89ea-66b3c258dbdb" facs="#m-b483a1e3-4872-4a90-b00b-c2c6059e7104" label="lyrics-like">minos dícere cathólica religióne</l><l xml:id="m-aef9c8d0-828e-4b0d-8096-82eac22969a5" facs="#m-ce9d439d-8419-4afd-8ebf-93875ff66f6d" label="lyrics-like">tâtem:*minor Pâtre secúndum</l><l xml:id="m-509fbe9f-7d87-4423-abd5-c8b3dfdee05c" facs="#m-aae8048f-bac9-465e-9cf3-78380dadd240" label="lyrics-like">prohibémur.</l><l xml:id="m-f8142a3f-5299-4f3c-a570-12da856110c2" facs="#m-70e1a784-0171-4536-8761-5e81566303a0" label="lyrics-like">humanitátem.</l><l xml:id="m-4e4395d3-4440-45ff-8df3-f31afee3804f" facs="#m-842db804-57ac-4560-bd0b-05b7d04de946" label="lyrics-like">Qui licet Déus sit et hómo, “non</l><l xml:id="m-b5349965-4649-4ec2-aa37-3ed12c9cf031" facs="#m-ab4bea3e-1ce9-4fee-8fce-e181d5e4ffd0" label="lyrics-like">Páter a núllo est fáctus:"nec</l><l xml:id="m-5ab11b7e-507b-4cf8-b0f6-47a90f6fc1ed" facs="#m-a6e33317-dfbe-4388-bf52-7e19c49cd7ac" label="lyrics-like">creâtus, nec genitus.</l><l xml:id="m-2fd57df6-398a-49e8-95bd-20cef86a9c3b" facs="#m-e5316596-f868-4909-9475-a69016cd4ee2" label="lyrics-like">dúo tamen, sed únus est Christus:</l><l xml:id="m-a3c6290c-5942-4acf-9534-f98719f5a1f6" facs="#m-33e625d8-1b02-4729-affe-772550d4859b" label="lyrics-like">Filius a Pâtre sólo est:on</l><l xml:id="m-b930fc62-3b0d-4697-bf32-fa686f939c46" facs="#m-59b11cae-baf6-40fb-a5d5-a6af2fcfd795" label="lyrics-like">Unus autem non conversióne di¬</l><l xml:id="m-41d6129a-eea6-4709-9d54-8d26699aa7c7" facs="#m-642e951c-5757-48d8-b520-274a2bfe21f7" label="lyrics-like">fáctus, nec creátus, sed génitus.</l><l xml:id="m-30bdd326-cc05-4570-b465-3317172a22f0" facs="#m-7fd4a377-efc1-458a-bb3d-e7de6a16761a" label="lyrics-like">vinitátis in cârnem, * sed assum¬</l><l xml:id="m-fdd5a0a9-4be3-4b0f-89c1-816ec5ee4eef" facs="#m-d421fd51-e5be-47c9-9c29-c770b733ceb3" label="lyrics-like">Spiritus Sánctus a Pâtre et Filio:</l><l xml:id="m-540097ca-3fbb-4167-b431-e5c713a6387a" facs="#m-f9009747-8302-4e81-ae33-4e7987341daa" label="lyrics-like">ptióne humanitátis in Déum:</l><l xml:id="m-58e51403-af8d-4573-9b04-c6195be5750b" facs="#m-71d57a31-208d-438e-96a5-565dfe7ee178" label="lyrics-like">Unus omníno non confusióne</l><l xml:id="m-d9812a65-06b1-4a97-9ec7-2ca0f9cf73a4" facs="#m-b02e88f5-1618-4773-93b2-34a04c291afb" label="lyrics-like">non fáctus, nec creátus, nec génitus,</l><l xml:id="m-67b9f885-f7da-4c63-b16f-b75e00ec5bfa" facs="#m-d546b5d8-58f4-4908-b6ed-6272dda38e61" label="lyrics-like">sed procédens.</l><l xml:id="m-b9fd04ad-844e-4854-8eaf-80ac0146d041" facs="#m-b802fe25-ac74-46a6-9618-95669e6ab824" label="lyrics-like">substántiae,“sed unitâte persó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0c5dea74-e2b9-44ba-9199-36b632624f8e" facs="#m-4317f87c-dfc4-4ecb-8d5a-cae9926b563d" label="lyrics-like">Unus ergo Páter, non tres Pá¬</l><l xml:id="m-ec2f2749-eb77-44e3-956d-453df313b4b9" facs="#m-7bf71fd1-5516-4aae-bac4-d0abe6213d98" label="ambiguous">nae.</l><l xml:id="m-e0fa8797-2629-477b-8083-a29588b4a48a" facs="#m-b4afeb75-82e4-4711-8bd3-45f6b221ab88" label="lyrics-like">tres:t únus Filius, non tres Filii:a</l><l xml:id="m-42bcab70-b94b-4988-bcef-f9675ec15520" facs="#m-1081c426-13a0-4e8f-b99f-a7f644d27f2a" label="lyrics-like">Nam sicut ánima rationális et</l><l xml:id="m-baf54fbf-97ef-47d7-8a1d-151e124e18aa" facs="#m-3587b3c5-30d1-4178-868b-af59a4735439" label="lyrics-like">únus Spiritus Sánctus, non tres</l><l xml:id="m-b3d6517c-0c8e-404c-aa8e-ac7fd8a9d6ef" facs="#m-5342724e-6b30-446d-bb7a-ff821618936f" label="lyrics-like">cáro únus est hómo:*ita Déus et</l><l xml:id="m-54405d7d-fd9b-4f06-8e05-3220b48ddcaf" facs="#m-8f8b4a81-f7ed-4aa9-87a9-1a3df83e8401" label="lyrics-like">spiritus sáncti.</l><l xml:id="m-2d42578d-a446-4334-b2f4-4c29a04240f9" facs="#m-409013e8-d03b-4848-a5ad-44ec6df041cf" label="lyrics-like">hómo únus est Christus.</l><l xml:id="m-f48f2653-d59d-4d0f-998f-d57e61123a78" facs="#m-4c335593-84a4-40fe-8b14-a298e1dec19d" label="lyrics-like">Et in hac Trinitáte nihil prius</l><l xml:id="m-545e2419-44b0-45fa-9fb0-3810035ecd52" facs="#m-55cf1bb9-7466-46bd-a762-2f7fc3beb93d" label="lyrics-like">Qui pássus est pro salúte nóstra,</l><l xml:id="m-71336c6a-4fd9-41aa-85a2-b5530e24f573" facs="#m-70cabcbf-e7e0-406b-8aa2-063485b8c031" label="lyrics-like">aut postérius, t nihil május aut</l><l xml:id="m-1774de56-d4f9-43b7-96c6-94b4eb758c91" facs="#m-cd12b2b8-bfcf-48d0-8a52-1a4420f91f17" label="lyrics-like">descéndit ad inferos:* tértia die</l><l xml:id="m-aa78d4ae-5d81-4582-9e49-c1e2e6a33f26" facs="#m-7b6bf490-2d69-4d88-8480-0c14ff2ed2f1" label="lyrics-like">minus: * sed tótae tres persó¬</l><l xml:id="m-ef75b296-6c45-459e-8735-ed69084e21d0" facs="#m-0d5c720e-46cf-41f9-8b44-810fe63ae0dd" label="lyrics-like">resurréxit a mórtuis.</l><l xml:id="m-e322e239-3cae-4116-bdc2-b7651b8a7325" facs="#m-e87e97ea-8cd0-4264-ba2a-7b0b514d7582" label="lyrics-like">Ascéndit ad caélos, sédet ad déx¬</l><l xml:id="m-eeda718b-0c42-4e1d-84a7-8d6262065025" facs="#m-39c81e8d-4255-4208-bb0c-94a9f2f3b3e8" label="lyrics-like">nae coaetérnae sibi sunt et coae¬</l><l xml:id="m-7318d8a2-f79e-42cb-9358-03cfd8a89800" facs="#m-18f5d98a-262c-4292-a53a-cef4256c802c" label="lyrics-like">teram Déi Pátris omnipoténtis:"</l><l xml:id="m-748877ba-445a-4236-acc9-836da293e111" facs="#m-d58b6dff-dbf2-4a4e-bc2e-8ff7e7978c9f" label="lyrics-like">quáles.</l><l xml:id="m-96f6bd9b-5a19-4e26-97ac-71bb62fa43f7" facs="#m-7fbc885e-14c6-4a04-b028-ea8e5c4e7725" label="lyrics-like">Ita ut per ómnia, sicut jam supra</l><l xml:id="m-1c71e0ac-bc72-46f2-b0b0-ec36b21ff560" facs="#m-0e3995fe-9ab5-4482-80d9-0808edb89de7" label="lyrics-like">inde ventúrus est judicàre vivos et</l><l xml:id="m-a87fa5fc-8ad3-42b8-aacb-5c146ef86b3b" facs="#m-31cafdfe-29af-4975-8287-b9f78f46e301" label="lyrics-like">dictumest, fet únitas in Trinitâte,"</l><l xml:id="m-ff6eb61b-d06d-45bf-a638-115a28d49fa9" facs="#m-ce99f4e2-c1d5-499c-b45b-f34bcb449d72" label="lyrics-like">mórtuos.</l><l xml:id="m-31a664f5-6ca0-4fc5-848f-dfc56214b71f" facs="#m-d1717149-4308-4fdc-a5f5-3d8702700404" label="lyrics-like">Ad cújus advéntum ómnes hómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b1b096d6-cc7b-41ae-9984-8eeaa3c7d66c" facs="#m-63ea74ad-4ad8-4a23-ae74-240a051f0501" label="lyrics-like">et Trinitas in unitáte veneránda</l><l xml:id="m-dbd2ca62-b2e2-4b7f-a958-3d62a635d18f" facs="#m-95c3abe5-91e8-40e3-82a5-adb815e9989d" label="ambiguous">sit.</l><l xml:id="m-6855c5aa-b886-4119-9ce6-ede1b072fbba" facs="#m-f2e5bcb7-de9a-4fa3-a04e-994d16a978f8" label="lyrics-like">nes resúrgere hábent cum corpóri¬</l><l xml:id="m-3bda126e-3e48-47b5-8a5c-c0139935850e" facs="#m-1e4b575a-c50a-4a6a-a27d-71e7939cd841" label="lyrics-like">Qui vult ergo sálvus ésse, “ita</l><l xml:id="m-35752bbe-a330-4604-bfe1-e0823c3ca2c2" facs="#m-d9d40253-066d-4447-bdc4-f7c7f3549dc9" label="lyrics-like">bus suis"*et redditúri sunt de fá¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ec73618-c0fa-496b-8d6c-bb13f70c8066" facs="#m-0e09390e-8895-4bcf-875b-4a3d3b955216" label="lyrics-like">de Trinitâte sentiat.</l><l xml:id="m-80650a3c-c514-4b30-a18e-a990eb3ab013" facs="#m-fad4042b-0023-47f1-aebf-d893097fa379" label="lyrics-like">ctis própriis ratiónem.</l><l xml:id="m-4e45bc93-233a-4ca2-903b-3a359b667e8b" facs="#m-af65d3af-f4c5-4656-8920-33632f1be070" label="lyrics-like">Et qui bóna egérunt, ibunt in</l><l xml:id="m-16452d94-7b12-40b8-9a91-a53f7d042eef" facs="#m-74c28bf6-26a6-472c-901a-82238e0a6adc" label="lyrics-like">Sed necessárium est ad aetérnam</l><l xml:id="m-bdea2d66-c942-4cc1-9dec-11ef665e0c15" facs="#m-4968925c-a69c-4063-987f-16e135b0efbc" label="lyrics-like">salútem, "ut Incarnatiónem quoque</l><l xml:id="m-e67c7888-2231-4b6a-af6a-07cd2e007771" facs="#m-1d512fdc-7d43-4576-9955-4e6d9377186c" label="lyrics-like">vitam aetérnan:“ qui vero mála¬</l><l xml:id="m-b74b918f-717f-4503-8cf3-ef6422b65ecc" facs="#m-f3a0e265-34a2-4a54-9423-6438e2c48d5d" label="lyrics-like">in ignem aetérnum.</l><l xml:id="m-88dd82cf-7519-48f5-be72-68a28e8b1c1c" facs="#m-f70f3421-2779-47c5-87e1-62333e365ae2" label="lyrics-like">Dómini nóstri Jésu Christi fidéliter</l><l xml:id="m-4c10f6f0-414b-4573-8085-13c4c2d5e2e4" facs="#m-9bb8a9d8-4060-4197-a669-ddfabd139145" label="lyrics-like">Haec est fides cathólica, t quam</l><l xml:id="m-b238ad80-fed4-46bf-9cfa-cbb678e8e987" facs="#m-55a8ebfa-e0bd-407b-abe5-b971c39408bf" label="lyrics-like">erédat</l><l xml:id="m-44d4f643-f7d7-479b-bc32-b5a05bbc12fe" facs="#m-fd2fb1aa-91c4-4522-ae3b-96e5e01de1bc" label="lyrics-like">Est ergo fides récta, ut credámus</l><l xml:id="m-d9e2064f-8b0f-4d87-a082-af81728792c7" facs="#m-1afc97cb-4fa7-42a4-8907-dc3028efcfe5" label="lyrics-like">nisi quisque fidéliter firmiterque</l><l xml:id="m-03c47882-331c-4810-81b2-e4cb66a77500" facs="#m-94259d6d-6456-4c1a-848b-4ecef631eed1" label="lyrics-like">crediderit, *salvus ésse non pó¬</l><l xml:id="m-024df1c6-6187-48e2-bcd1-966bcb5facc9" facs="#m-8d93746f-1066-420b-9784-bb83f53fcb2a" label="lyrics-like">et confiteámur, t quia Dóminus</l><l xml:id="m-babd004f-64d6-4f6c-b169-60fbf98e2b92" facs="#m-27c6a3df-2902-477f-928f-1f3c4c53f3db" label="lyrics-like">nóster Jésus Christus Déi Filius,</l><l xml:id="m-09293594-8e9a-4faa-a0a7-0e935e16c115" facs="#m-1b21be08-ed17-4a8c-974d-e25df34cfb68" label="ambiguous">terit.</l><l xml:id="m-673cab8c-a155-4bab-9bd5-5cfe313d67a5" facs="#m-85429c6e-aaf1-435c-bf2f-2406944c0540" label="lyrics-like">Glória Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-0a82c039-631b-45dd-ac6b-8f8a3b99406c" facs="#m-5c537218-ad65-422a-90fc-9721b2074f08" label="lyrics-like">péus et hómo est.</l><l xml:id="m-a88e65ec-2c2a-4c38-a8b2-402716beba73" facs="#m-53c087dc-6b45-4ab9-b906-c8add943efb8" label="text-like">During the Year.</l><l xml:id="m-0c01016d-2d84-4ea8-a531-4d190e2fe757" facs="#m-dda71e04-ca26-4dee-ad70-7d67c5b48de0" label="ambiguous">Ant. E</l><l xml:id="m-1d25cc28-2f65-4c5c-aaf4-4fc7718d1193" facs="#m-a82c9cce-4bf1-4c40-bdea-11d74b964928" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú- ia, confi-témi-ni Dómi-no, quóni-am in</l><l xml:id="m-14196ded-795b-4bd4-8373-49e2d54a0965" facs="#m-94504e6e-05ac-4665-8091-e493ae4fafd0" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-73e1e421-d7a1-4160-8acd-ad093daa3811" facs="#m-cd77123d-2ae9-4bbf-9536-99ec66e34b67" label="lyrics-like">saécu-lum mi-se-ri-córdi-a é-jus,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>